  "rationale": [
    "Agency Agents provides a broad agent persona catalog, domain taxonomy, machine-readable team/runbook rosters, handoff templates and multi-runtime conversion patterns.",
    "FA3 already owns agent execution, delegation, communication, action execution, decision advisory, resource, security, evidence and durable orchestration boundaries, so importing NEXUS or runtime-specific converter outputs as authority would create duplicate control planes.",
    "The upstream corpus is therefore treated as immutable untrusted scoped reference content and normalized into existing FA3 contracts only after explicit admission.",
    "The upstream MIT license is recorded as provenance; source redistribution must preserve the applicable MIT copyright and permission notice."
  ],
